  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The way things are, everyone appears they have the same trust rank and performance rating if you have achromatopsia. Even those with simply \"less than perfect\" vision are having trouble reading the UI. I understand some people like the tiny \"minimalist\" UI, but having the option to bring back the text labels or increase their size would be a great feature. \n\nI also had some trouble figuring out if anyone was on android or not when hopping worlds because the icon is so tiny. Is the mutual icon also gone now? I was hoping they'd push the separate friends/group feature this update, but they've simply deleted the feature altogether. I'm probably leaving out a lot of other aspects, but these are what come to mind at the moment.",
